      "value": "@{59e59c1cda46f215cddef5f6|full_name}: Yeah. Makes sense. I understand all the benefits. I think at launch we made \"friends of friends\" and skipped \"friends only\" to save some time as community was fairly small. As we grow in traffic it's making more sense to apply some effort to that.",
