      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "value": "Agree 100%. Considering many users friend literally everyone they see or meet to get into full instances, this means that if I'm running a theater for my friends (and want them to be able to rejoin easily), I'm also potentially opening up the list to effectively random people.\n\nI usually run my theater events in invite-only mode for this reason, and have to deal with accepting invites for the duration.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
